__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.env

# The production config, at the repo root — never committed, it holds provider
# keys. Root-anchored (`/config.yaml`) on purpose: unanchored, this pattern also
# matched `tests/fixtures/config.yaml`, which silently kept the test fixture out
# of the repo. The suite passed locally, where the file existed, and CI failed on
# a checkout that had never seen it.
/config.yaml

# Leftovers from the removed METRICS_PERSIST feature. Counters are deliberately
# never persisted (see AGENTS.md); these stay ignored only so an old deploy's
# files don't show up as untracked.
data/
metrics_state.json

# Claude Code per-machine overrides (skills under .claude/skills/ are tracked)
.claude/settings.local.json
